::node [id=minimum type=stage confidence=0.95 scope=all updated=2026-11-09]
::dense
cold-start|method-chain|store-chain|sink|stage-or-all
::end
::full
Cold start loads the design minimum read and continues to the sink. When the task names one stage, resolve that stage instead of this node.
::end
::warning
Stop on an unread or same-indication pair hit. A failed positive control emits nothing. Do not emit a sequence without the disclaimer and two killing assays.
::end
