::node [id=design-binder type=stage confidence=0.95 scope=all updated=2026-11-09]
::dense
indication|epitope|blinded-control|hard-screens|killing-assays
::end
::full
Generate only after the catalogue gate and a blinded positive control.
::end
::warning
Same-indication evidence stops design. An unread pair hit stops design. Prediction does not rank clinical utility.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] skills/design-binder.md
->[:precedes] traces
::end
::end

