::node [id=bench type=stage confidence=0.95 scope=all updated=2026-11-09]
::dense
tier|set-union|core-hash|no-pool|pose-not-metric
::end
::full
Append tiered partial work outside the repository.
::end
::note
Do not pool tiers. A bench line is not a catalogue row and not a trace line.
::end
::edges
->[:requires] systems/use-bench.md
->[:precedes] record
::end
::end

