::node [id=halt-early type=assertion confidence=1.00 scope=all updated=2026-11-09]
::dense
hit-unread|same-indication|positive-control-failed|no-assay
::end
::warning
An unread pair hit, a failed positive control, or a missing killing assay ends emission.
::end
::assertion
trigger: after [design-binder]
check: catalogue gate open and control passed and two killing assays named
on-pass: ->[:proceed] traces
on-fail: ->[:escalate] design-binder
::end
::end

::node [id=stop type=assertion confidence=1.00 scope=all updated=2026-11-09]
::dense
stop|sink|run-campaign
::end
::assertion
trigger: after [run]
check: endpoint("systems/run-campaign.md")
on-pass: ->[:proceed] run
on-fail: ->[:escalate] minimum
::end
::end

